{%- comment -%}
  Seoul Glow Lab - Submenu Panel (Slide-from-right nested panel)
  Usage: {% render 'casa-submenu-panel', link: link, panel_id: 'infinity-mirrors' %}
  Params:
    - link: parent nav link object (with .links children)
    - panel_id: unique string for the panel ID
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} Try link.object first (auto-resolved by Shopify), then fallback to handle lookup {%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign panel_collection = nil
  if link.type == 'collection_link'
    assign panel_collection = link.object
  endif
  if panel_collection == blank
    assign panel_collection = collections[link.handle]
  endif
-%}

{%- comment -%} ── Variant detection (same logic as mega menu) ── {%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign submenu_variant = 'glow'
  assign _title_handle = link.title | downcase | handle

  case _title_handle
    when 'lighting', 'mirrors', 'shop', 'shop-all', 'infinity-mirrors', 'lamps', 'best-sellers'
      assign submenu_variant = 'glow'
    when 'home-decor', 'new-arrivals', 'collections', 'decor', 'furniture', 'inspiration'
      assign submenu_variant = 'lifestyle'
    when 'customer-care', 'customer-service', 'support', 'help', 'faq', 'contact', 'about'
      assign submenu_variant = 'support'
  endcase

  if panel_collection and panel_collection.metafields.sgl.menu_style != blank
    assign submenu_variant = panel_collection.metafields.sgl.menu_style
  endif
-%}

{%- comment -%}
  Glass variant suppressed — same brand-Ink lock as the parent
  drawer. drawer_glassmorphic merchant setting no longer affects
  the visual surface. Chrome stays brand Ink (or Paper for the
  Lifestyle variant).
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="casa-submenu-panel casa-submenu-panel--{{ submenu_variant }}" id="casa-submenu-{{ panel_id }}" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="{{ link.title }} submenu">
  <div class="casa-submenu__frost-cover" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  {%- comment -%} Header with back button {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="casa-submenu__header">
    <button class="casa-submenu-back" data-casa-submenu-close="{{ panel_id }}" aria-label="Back to main menu">
      {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'chevron-left', size: 20 -%}
    </button>
    <div class="casa-submenu__title-group">
      <span class="casa-submenu__label">Browse</span>
      <h3 class="casa-submenu__title">{{ link.title }}</h3>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Scrollable content {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="casa-submenu__content">

    {%- comment -%}
      Brand-voice headline + "Featured · Most-Loved" hero card.
      Lifted to the top of every panel (was previously only inside
      the subcategory branch — meant Lighting / Mirrors / Home Decor
      never showed the desktop megamenu's Option G hero moment
      because their collections have products and the products
      branch won, skipping the hero render).

      Headline uses the locked italic-gradient `<em>` typography
      (memory: brand_typography_locked_2026-05-04.md). Hero card
      scans `link.links` for a child flagged
      `casa.badge=featured/best/popular/hot`; falls back to the
      global Best Sellers collection; last-resort falls back to
      the linked collection itself (so every Glow / Lifestyle
      panel always has a curated visual moment).

      Suppressed when:
        - submenu_variant is 'support' — utility menus shouldn't
          have a marketing card
        - the linked collection has metafield `casa.hide_submenu_featured`
          set to true (per-link kill switch for merchants)
        - the parent passes show_featured: false (section-level toggle)
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if show_featured == nil -%}{%- assign show_featured = true -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- if submenu_variant == 'support' -%}
      {%- assign show_featured = false -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if panel_collection.metafields.sgl.hide_submenu_featured -%}
      {%- assign show_featured = false -%}
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- assign _hero_handle = '' -%}
    {%- assign _hero_link = nil -%}
    {%- assign _hero_collection = nil -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      Brand-voice headline — renders for every variant, including
      Support (which uses "How can we help?" to mirror the desktop
      megamenu). Italic-gradient <em> per the locked typography
      decision.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <h3 class="casa-submenu__cat-headline">
      {%- if submenu_variant == 'support' -%}How can we <em>help?</em>
      {%- elsif submenu_variant == 'lifestyle' -%}Curated <em>decor.</em>
      {%- else -%}Find your <em>light.</em>
      {%- endif -%}
    </h3>

    {%- comment -%}
      Support featured card — Contact Us treatment matching the
      desktop megamenu. Rendered when submenu_variant is 'support'
      and at least one support setting is filled. Each contact
      method is its own tappable row (mailto: / tel: / link).
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if submenu_variant == 'support' -%}
      {%- assign _has_support_card = false -%}
      {%- if support_title != blank or support_description != blank or support_email != blank or support_phone != blank or support_chat_label != blank -%}
        {%- assign _has_support_card = true -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if _has_support_card -%}
        <div class="casa-submenu__support-card">
          {%- if featured_label_support != blank -%}
            <span class="casa-submenu__support-label">
              {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'headphones', size: 14 -%}
              {{ featured_label_support }}
            </span>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if support_title != blank -%}
            <h4 class="casa-submenu__support-title">{{ support_title | newline_to_br }}</h4>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if support_description != blank -%}
            <p class="casa-submenu__support-desc">{{ support_description | newline_to_br }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if support_email != blank or support_phone != blank or support_chat_label != blank -%}
            <div class="casa-submenu__support-methods">
              {%- if support_email != blank -%}
                <a href="mailto:{{ support_email }}" class="casa-submenu__support-method">
                  <span class="casa-submenu__support-method-icon">
                    {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'mail', size: 16 -%}
                  </span>
                  <span class="casa-submenu__support-method-text">{{ support_email }}</span>
                  <span class="casa-submenu__support-method-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                    {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'chevron-right', size: 14 -%}
                  </span>
                </a>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if support_phone != blank -%}
                <a href="tel:{{ support_phone | remove: ' ' | remove: '(' | remove: ')' | remove: '-' }}" class="casa-submenu__support-method">
                  <span class="casa-submenu__support-method-icon">
                    {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'smartphone', size: 16 -%}
                  </span>
                  <span class="casa-submenu__support-method-text">{{ support_phone }}</span>
                  <span class="casa-submenu__support-method-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                    {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'chevron-right', size: 14 -%}
                  </span>
                </a>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if support_chat_label != blank -%}
                <a href="{{ support_chat_link | default: '/pages/contact-us' }}" class="casa-submenu__support-method">
                  <span class="casa-submenu__support-method-icon">
                    {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'message-circle', size: 16 -%}
                  </span>
                  <span class="casa-submenu__support-method-text">{{ support_chat_label }}</span>
                  <span class="casa-submenu__support-method-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
                    {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'chevron-right', size: 14 -%}
                  </span>
                </a>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if support_btn_text != blank -%}
            <a href="{{ support_btn_link | default: '/pages/contact-us' }}" class="casa-submenu__support-btn btn btn-primary">
              {{ support_btn_text }}
              {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'arrow-right', size: 14 -%}
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if show_featured -%}

      {%- comment -%} Resolve hero — first flagged child, else global Best Sellers, else linked collection. {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- for _scan_link in link.links -%}
        {%- if _hero_handle != '' -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign _scan_url_parts = _scan_link.url | split: '/' -%}
        {%- assign _scan_handle = _scan_url_parts | last -%}
        {%- assign _scan_collection = collections[_scan_handle] -%}
        {%- assign _scan_badge = '' -%}
        {%- if _scan_collection.metafields.sgl.badge != blank -%}
          {%- assign _scan_badge = _scan_collection.metafields.sgl.badge | downcase -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if _scan_badge == 'featured' or _scan_badge == 'best' or _scan_badge == 'popular' or _scan_badge == 'hot' -%}
          {%- assign _hero_handle = _scan_handle -%}
          {%- assign _hero_link = _scan_link -%}
          {%- assign _hero_collection = _scan_collection -%}
        {%- elsif _scan_handle == 'best-sellers' or _scan_handle == 'bestsellers' -%}
          {%- assign _hero_handle = _scan_handle -%}
          {%- assign _hero_link = _scan_link -%}
          {%- assign _hero_collection = _scan_collection -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        Hero fallback chain (changed 2026-05-11 — flipped order so
        the linked collection's own image wins before Best Sellers,
        otherwise Home Decor showed a Best Sellers infinity-mirror
        cover that has nothing to do with home decor):
          1. featured child (any link.links child flagged
             casa.badge = featured/best/popular/hot) — explicit
             merchant curation always wins
          2. linked collection itself, if it has an image — most
             on-topic visual for the category (Home Decor cover for
             Home Decor, Lighting cover for Lighting, etc.)
          3. global Best Sellers — last resort for utility/curated
             top-levels like "Shop All" or anything without its
             own cover image
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign _hero_url = '' -%}
      {%- assign _hero_title = '' -%}
      {%- if _hero_link != nil -%}
        {%- assign _hero_url = _hero_link.url -%}
        {%- assign _hero_title = _hero_link.title -%}
      {%- elsif panel_collection != blank and panel_collection.image != blank -%}
        {%- assign _hero_url = link.url -%}
        {%- assign _hero_title = link.title -%}
        {%- assign _hero_collection = panel_collection -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- assign _global_best = collections['best-sellers'] -%}
        {%- if _global_best != blank and _global_best.image != blank -%}
          {%- assign _hero_url = '/collections/best-sellers' -%}
          {%- assign _hero_title = 'Best Sellers' -%}
          {%- assign _hero_collection = _global_best -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if _hero_url != '' and _hero_collection.image != blank -%}
        {%- assign _hero_focal_x = _hero_collection.metafields.sgl.focal_x -%}
        {%- assign _hero_focal_y = _hero_collection.metafields.sgl.focal_y -%}
        {%- if _hero_focal_x != blank -%}{%- assign _hero_focal_x_pct = _hero_focal_x | times: 100 -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign _hero_focal_x_pct = 50 -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Default focal-y = 30% (was 50%). Most Casa collection
          covers are 1:1 square photos where the subject sits in
          the upper half (typical product photography). At 50/50
          crop into a 3:2 card, the top arc of the subject gets
          clipped by the visible band starting at source row ~60
          (out of 360). 30% biases the visible band upward so the
          full subject lands inside the crop. Per-collection
          casa.focal_y metafield still wins if set.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if _hero_focal_y != blank -%}{%- assign _hero_focal_y_pct = _hero_focal_y | times: 100 -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign _hero_focal_y_pct = 30 -%}{%- endif -%}
        <a href="{{ _hero_url }}" class="casa-submenu__cat-hero">
          <img class="casa-submenu__cat-hero-img"
               src="{{ _hero_collection.image | image_url: width: 760 }}"
               srcset="{{ _hero_collection.image | image_url: width: 380 }} 380w, {{ _hero_collection.image | image_url: width: 760 }} 760w, {{ _hero_collection.image | image_url: width: 1140 }} 1140w"
               sizes="(max-width: 480px) 360px, 380px"
               alt="{{ _hero_collection.image.alt | escape | default: _hero_title | escape }}"
               width="760" height="507"
               loading="lazy" decoding="async"
               style="object-position: {{ _hero_focal_x_pct }}% {{ _hero_focal_y_pct }}%">
          <span class="casa-submenu__cat-hero-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="casa-submenu__cat-hero-content">
            <span class="casa-submenu__cat-hero-text">
              <span class="casa-submenu__cat-hero-tag">Featured · Most-Loved</span>
              <span class="casa-submenu__cat-hero-name">{{ _hero_title }}</span>
            </span>
            <span class="casa-submenu__cat-hero-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="9 6 15 12 9 18"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </span>
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      Product or subcategory list.
      Category child-links take priority over the product showcase, so the mobile
      "Shop" menu shows Cleansers / Toners / Serums / etc. (mirrors the desktop
      mega menu). A collection can force the product showcase back on by setting
      the metafield sgl.show_submenu_products = true. (Pattern adapted from Casa
      di Lumo's hide_submenu_products toggle.)
      Products are also always suppressed when:
        - submenu_variant is 'support' (utility menus only show child links)
        - the parent passes show_products: false (section-level toggle)
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign _has_products = false -%}
    {%- if show_products == nil -%}{%- assign show_products = true -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- if submenu_variant == 'support' -%}
      {%- assign show_products = false -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- assign _force_products = false -%}
    {%- if panel_collection and panel_collection.metafields.sgl.show_submenu_products -%}
      {%- assign _force_products = true -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if link.links.size > 0 and _force_products == false -%}
      {%- assign show_products = false -%}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if show_products and panel_collection and panel_collection.products.size > 0 -%}
      {%- assign _has_products = true -%}
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="casa-submenu__section-title">
      {%- if _has_products -%}
        Popular in {{ link.title }}
      {%- elsif submenu_variant == 'support' and link.links.size > 0 -%}
        {{ link.title | upcase }} TOPICS
      {%- elsif link.links.size > 0 -%}
        Browse {{ link.title }}
      {%- else -%}
        {{ link.title }}
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div class="casa-submenu__list">
      {%- if _has_products -%}
        {%- comment -%} Show products from this collection {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign _product_limit = submenu_product_limit | default: 6 -%}
        {%- for product in panel_collection.products limit: _product_limit -%}
          <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="casa-submenu__item">
            <div class="casa-submenu__item-img">
              {%- if product.featured_image != blank -%}
                {%- comment -%}
                  sizes: .casa-submenu__item-img is a fixed 56×56 box the
                  photo fills; sizes-less srcset would default the slot to
                  100vw — see snippets/casa-cart-items.liquid.
                {%- endcomment -%}
                {{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 112 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'casa-submenu__item-photo', sizes: '56px' }}
              {%- else -%}
                /* perf-justified: submenu panel layered over open drawer — same modal lifecycle as parent */
                <div class="casa-submenu__item-shape casa-octagon" style="width:32px;height:32px;background:conic-gradient(from var(--angle),var(--submenu-accent-1),var(--submenu-accent-2),var(--submenu-accent-1));animation:casa-rotate 8s linear infinite;"></div>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>
            <div class="casa-submenu__item-content">
              <span class="casa-submenu__item-name">{{ product.title }}</span>
              <div class="casa-submenu__item-meta">
                <span class="casa-submenu__item-price">{{ product.price | money_with_currency }}</span>
                {%- if product.compare_at_price > product.price -%}
                  {%- comment -%}
                    Was-price uses | money (NOT money_with_currency): the active
                    price above already carries the currency code, so repeating it
                    on the strikethrough is redundant — and in a long-currency
                    market (VND: "8.841.000 VND"), two coded strings side by side
                    each wrapped at the space before the code, fragmenting the row
                    into a broken 2×2 price grid. Same fix + rationale as
                    casa-product-card (commit c8ea957f, merchant-approved
                    currency-code exception scoped to the redundant was-price).
                    The active price keeps its code so Markets currency is never
                    ambiguous.
                  {%- endcomment -%}
                  <s class="casa-submenu__item-price-old">{{ product.compare_at_price | money }}</s>
                {%- endif -%}

                {%- comment -%}
                  Badges from the same source as the product grid:
                    1. custom.badges metafield (list — up to 2 in this compact list)
                    2. tag fallback (bestseller / new) when no metafield is set
                  Class naming matches casa-product-card so colors stay
                  consistent across the storefront — Theme Settings →
                  Casa Product Card Colors flow through.
                  `show_badges` defaults to true if the parent didn't pass
                  it (preserves prior behaviour for direct callers).
                {%- endcomment -%}
                {%- if show_badges == nil -%}{%- assign show_badges = true -%}{%- endif -%}
                {%- if show_badges -%}
                  {%- assign submenu_badges_meta = product.metafields.custom.badges.value -%}
                  {%- if submenu_badges_meta != blank -%}
                    {%- for submenu_badge_item in submenu_badges_meta limit: 2 -%}
                      {%- if submenu_badge_item != blank -%}
                        <span class="casa-submenu__item-badge casa-submenu__item-badge--meta casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-{{ submenu_badge_item | handleize }}">{{ submenu_badge_item }}</span>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    {%- endfor -%}
                  {%- elsif product.tags contains 'bestseller' or product.tags contains 'best-seller' -%}
                    <span class="casa-submenu__item-badge casa-submenu__item-badge--bestseller">Bestseller</span>
                  {%- elsif product.tags contains 'new' -%}
                    <span class="casa-submenu__item-badge casa-submenu__item-badge--new">New</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="casa-submenu__item-arrow">
              {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'chevron-right', size: 16 -%}
            </div>
          </a>
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- elsif link.links.size > 0 -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          Subcategory list — matches casa-mega-menu.liquid logic so
          the mobile submenu mirrors the desktop mega menu visually.
          Resolves real handle from URL (link.handle drifts from title),
          looks up collection + page, picks image / icon / subtitle
          per the same priority chain.

          NOTE: Brand-voice headline + Featured · Most-Loved hero card
          previously lived here, but were lifted to the top of the
          panel (see show_featured block above) so they render on
          panels that DO have products too. `_hero_handle` is set
          there and remains in scope here, so the loop below still
          correctly skips the hero item when iterating subcategories.
        {%- endcomment -%}

        {%- comment -%}
          Detect manual `—` section dividers — same logic as desktop.
          When present, render in merchant order via the original
          single-pass loop. Otherwise (Glow / Lifestyle without
          manual dividers), run the 5-pass auto-group renderer below.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign _has_manual_sections = false -%}
        {%- for _ck in link.links -%}
          {%- assign _ck_first1 = _ck.title | strip | slice: 0, 1 -%}
          {%- if _ck_first1 == '—' or _ck_first1 == '–' -%}
            {%- assign _has_manual_sections = true -%}
            {%- break -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}

        {%- if submenu_variant == 'support' or _has_manual_sections -%}
        {%- for child_link in link.links -%}
          {%- assign _child_url_parts = child_link.url | split: '/' -%}
          {%- assign _child_url_handle = _child_url_parts | last -%}

          {%- comment -%}
            Skip the hero item — already rendered as the hero card.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- if _hero_handle != '' and _child_url_handle == _hero_handle -%}
            {%- continue -%}
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- comment -%} Resolve the collection from the link object first
            (a menu link's handle is a handleized title, not the collection
            handle, so collections[handle] often misses). {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- assign _child_collection = nil -%}
          {%- if child_link.type == 'collection_link' and child_link.object != blank -%}
            {%- assign _child_collection = child_link.object -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- assign _child_collection = collections[_child_url_handle] -%}
            {%- if _child_collection == blank -%}{%- assign _child_collection = collections[child_link.handle] -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- assign _child_page = pages[_child_url_handle] -%}

          {%- comment -%} Image priority: collection metafield → collection featured → page metafield {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- assign _child_image = nil -%}
          {%- if _child_collection.metafields.sgl.menu_image != blank -%}
            {%- assign _child_image = _child_collection.metafields.sgl.menu_image -%}
          {%- elsif _child_collection != blank and _child_collection.image != blank -%}
            {%- assign _child_image = _child_collection.image -%}
          {%- elsif _child_page != blank and _child_page.metafields.custom.page_image != blank -%}
            {%- assign _child_image = _child_page.metafields.custom.page_image.value -%}
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- comment -%}
            Focal-point metafields (casa.focal_x / casa.focal_y, both
            number_decimal in 0–1 range). Anchors the thumbnail crop on
            the actual product instead of the geometric center, which
            slices random product edges off when the source image
            isn't perfectly composed. Default 50/50 (classic center
            crop) if either metafield is unset.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- assign _child_focal_x = _child_collection.metafields.sgl.focal_x -%}
          {%- assign _child_focal_y = _child_collection.metafields.sgl.focal_y -%}
          {%- if _child_focal_x != blank -%}
            {%- assign _child_focal_x_pct = _child_focal_x | times: 100 -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- assign _child_focal_x_pct = 50 -%}
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if _child_focal_y != blank -%}
            {%- assign _child_focal_y_pct = _child_focal_y | times: 100 -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- assign _child_focal_y_pct = 50 -%}
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- comment -%} Icon priority: collection metafield → page metafield → handle-mapped {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- assign _child_icon = 'hexagon' -%}
          {%- if _child_collection.metafields.sgl.icon != blank -%}
            {%- assign _child_icon = _child_collection.metafields.sgl.icon -%}
          {%- elsif _child_page != blank and _child_page.metafields.sgl.icon != blank -%}
            {%- assign _child_icon = _child_page.metafields.sgl.icon -%}
          {%- elsif submenu_variant == 'support' -%}
            {%- comment -%}
              Support icon resolution — three passes from most specific
              to most generic:
                1. URL-handle case (works when merchant uses canonical
                   handles like /pages/contact-us, /policies/refund-policy).
                2. Title-keyword fallback (catches merchant-custom URLs
                   like /apps/track123 or /pages/about-us-1 — what we
                   actually see in the live nav).
                3. `info` default — generic help-topic.
              `document` isn't defined in casa-icon, so terms uses `shield`.
              Keep names in sync with snippets/casa-icon.liquid.
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- assign _child_icon = '' -%}
            {%- case _child_url_handle -%}
              {%- when 'contact', 'contact-us' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'headphones' -%}
              {%- when 'shipping', 'shipping-policy' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'truck' -%}
              {%- when 'returns', 'refund-policy', 'refunds-returns' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'refresh' -%}
              {%- when 'warranty' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'shield-check' -%}
              {%- when 'faq' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'info' -%}
              {%- when 'our-story', 'about', 'about-us' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'users' -%}
              {%- when 'track-order', 'order-status' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'package' -%}
              {%- when 'customer-reviews', 'reviews' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'star' -%}
              {%- when 'installation', 'apollo-installation' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'zap' -%}
              {%- when 'privacy-policy', 'privacy' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'lock' -%}
              {%- when 'terms-of-service', 'terms' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'shield' -%}
            {%- endcase -%}
            {%- if _child_icon == '' -%}
              {%- assign _title_norm = child_link.title | downcase | strip -%}
              {%- if _title_norm contains 'track' or _title_norm contains 'order status' or _title_norm contains 'shipment' -%}
                {%- assign _child_icon = 'package' -%}
              {%- elsif _title_norm contains 'contact' or _title_norm contains 'support' or _title_norm contains 'get in touch' -%}
                {%- assign _child_icon = 'headphones' -%}
              {%- elsif _title_norm contains 'shipping' or _title_norm contains 'delivery' -%}
                {%- assign _child_icon = 'truck' -%}
              {%- elsif _title_norm contains 'refund' or _title_norm contains 'return' -%}
                {%- assign _child_icon = 'refresh' -%}
              {%- elsif _title_norm contains 'warranty' -%}
                {%- assign _child_icon = 'shield-check' -%}
              {%- elsif _title_norm contains 'review' or _title_norm contains 'testimonial' -%}
                {%- assign _child_icon = 'star' -%}
              {%- elsif _title_norm contains 'story' or _title_norm contains 'about' or _title_norm contains 'team' -%}
                {%- assign _child_icon = 'users' -%}
              {%- elsif _title_norm contains 'privacy' -%}
                {%- assign _child_icon = 'lock' -%}
              {%- elsif _title_norm contains 'terms' or _title_norm contains 'legal' -%}
                {%- assign _child_icon = 'shield' -%}
              {%- elsif _title_norm contains 'install' or _title_norm contains 'setup' or _title_norm contains 'how to' -%}
                {%- assign _child_icon = 'zap' -%}
              {%- elsif _title_norm contains 'faq' or _title_norm contains 'question' or _title_norm contains 'help' -%}
                {%- assign _child_icon = 'info' -%}
              {%- elsif _title_norm contains 'email' or _title_norm contains 'message' -%}
                {%- assign _child_icon = 'mail' -%}
              {%- elsif _title_norm contains 'reward' or _title_norm contains 'loyalty' -%}
                {%- assign _child_icon = 'gift' -%}
              {%- else -%}
                {%- assign _child_icon = 'info' -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- case _child_url_handle -%}
              {%- when 'all-lighting', 'all', 'lighting', 'shop-all' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'sun' -%}
              {%- when 'infinity-mirrors', 'mirrors', 'infinity' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'hexagon' -%}
              {%- when 'floor-lamps', 'floor-lamp' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'lamp' -%}
              {%- when 'table-lamps', 'table-lamp', 'desk-lamps' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'lamp' -%}
              {%- when 'wall-lamps', 'wall-lamp', 'wall-lights', 'sconces' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'sun' -%}
              {%- when 'led-neon-signs', 'neon-signs', 'neon', 'led-signs' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'zap' -%}
              {%- when 'bubble-girl-lamps', 'bubble-girls', 'bubble-lamps' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'sparkles' -%}
              {%- when 'mushroom-lamps', 'mushroom' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'moon' -%}
              {%- when 'new-arrivals', 'new' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'sparkles' -%}
              {%- when 'best-sellers', 'bestsellers', 'popular' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'star' -%}
              {%- when 'sale', 'on-sale' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'tag' -%}
              {%- when 'home-decor', 'decor', 'decoration' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'home' -%}
              {%- when 'furniture', 'tables', 'chairs' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'box' -%}
              {%- when 'accessories', 'accents' -%}{%- assign _child_icon = 'grid' -%}
            {%- endcase -%}
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- comment -%}
            Subtitle priority: collection description → page subtitle →
            "{N} items". No "Learn more" fallback — the chevron implies
            it, and rendering literal "Learn more" on every row was
            wasteful noise that the user explicitly called out.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- assign _child_subtitle = '' -%}
          {%- if _child_collection.metafields.sgl.description != blank -%}
            {%- assign _child_subtitle = _child_collection.metafields.sgl.description -%}
          {%- elsif _child_page != blank and _child_page.metafields.custom.page_subtitle != blank -%}
            {%- assign _child_subtitle = _child_page.metafields.custom.page_subtitle -%}
          {%- elsif _child_collection != blank -%}
            {%- assign _child_count = _child_collection.all_products_count | default: _child_collection.products_count | plus: 0 -%}
            {%- if _child_count > 0 -%}
              {%- assign _child_subtitle = _child_count | append: ' items' -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- comment -%}
            Option C — text-led, sectioned (mockups/megamenu-options.html).
            Section header convention: child link titles starting with
            `—` (em-dash) or `--` are rendered as a section header
            instead of a clickable item.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- assign _ch_first2 = child_link.title | strip | slice: 0, 2 -%}
          {%- assign _is_section = false -%}
          {%- if _ch_first2 == '——' or _ch_first2 == '--' -%}
            {%- assign _is_section = true -%}
          {%- else -%}
            {%- assign _ch_first1 = child_link.title | strip | slice: 0, 1 -%}
            {%- if _ch_first1 == '—' or _ch_first1 == '–' -%}
              {%- assign _is_section = true -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- if _is_section -%}
            <div class="casa-submenu__cat-section">
              {{ child_link.title | replace: '——', '' | replace: '—', '' | replace: '–', '' | replace: '--', '' | strip }}
            </div>
          {%- else -%}
            {%- assign _is_featured = false -%}
            {%- assign _bdg = '' -%}
            {%- if _child_collection.metafields.sgl.badge != blank -%}
              {%- assign _bdg = _child_collection.metafields.sgl.badge | downcase -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if _bdg == 'featured' or _bdg == 'best' or _bdg == 'popular' or _bdg == 'hot' -%}
              {%- assign _is_featured = true -%}
            {%- elsif _child_url_handle == 'best-sellers' or _child_url_handle == 'bestsellers' -%}
              {%- assign _is_featured = true -%}
            {%- endif -%}

            <a href="{{ child_link.url }}" class="casa-submenu__item casa-submenu__item--cat{% if _is_featured %} casa-submenu__item--featured{% endif %}">
              {%- if show_icons and submenu_variant == 'support' -%}
                <span class="casa-submenu__item-leadicon" aria-hidden="true">
                  {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: _child_icon, size: 18 -%}
                </span>
              {%- endif -%}
              <span class="casa-submenu__item-name">{{ child_link.title }}</span>
              {%- if _child_subtitle != blank -%}
                <span class="casa-submenu__item-count">{{ _child_subtitle }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
              <svg class="casa-submenu__item-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}

        {%- else -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
          Auto-group renderer (5 sub-passes) — same logic as desktop
          casa-mega-menu.liquid. Sorts children into Shop / Lamps /
          Walls & Surfaces / Home / More buckets so the mobile drawer
          matches the Option G mockup without admin work.
          ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign _section_labels = 'Shop|Lamps|Walls & Surfaces|Home|More' | split: '|' -%}
        {%- for _section_label in _section_labels -%}
          {%- assign _section_idx = forloop.index -%}
          {%- assign _section_rendered = false -%}

          {%- comment -%}
            Two priority passes per section — same as desktop. "all-*"
            overview entries always come first within their section.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- for _priority in (1..2) -%}
          {%- for child_link in link.links -%}
            {%- assign _child_url_parts = child_link.url | split: '/' -%}
            {%- assign _child_url_handle = _child_url_parts | last -%}

            {%- if _hero_handle != '' and _child_url_handle == _hero_handle -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- assign _ch_first1 = child_link.title | strip | slice: 0, 1 -%}
            {%- if _ch_first1 == '—' or _ch_first1 == '–' -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}

            {%- comment -%} Same broadened matcher as desktop — handle + title fallback for Shop bucket {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- assign _h = _child_url_handle | downcase -%}
            {%- assign _t = child_link.title | downcase | strip -%}
            {%- assign _belongs_to = 5 -%}
            {%- if _h contains 'all-product' or _h == 'all' or _h contains 'best-seller' or _h contains 'bestseller' or _h contains 'arrival' or _h == 'new' or _h contains 'whats-new' or _h contains 'gift' or _h contains 'sale' or _h contains 'perfect' or _t == 'new arrivals' or _t == 'best sellers' or _t == 'all products' or _t == 'sale' or _t == 'whats new' -%}
              {%- assign _belongs_to = 1 -%}
            {%- elsif _h contains 'lamp' or _h contains 'lighting' or _h contains 'sconce' or _h contains 'bubble' or _h contains 'mushroom' or _h contains 'apollo' or _h contains 'halo' or _h contains 'nova' or _h contains 'orbella' or _h contains 'genix' or _h contains 'aura' or _h contains 'nexus' or _h contains 'sphere' or _h contains 'donut' or _h contains 'thinker' or _h contains 'dancer' or _h contains 'fleur' -%}
              {%- assign _belongs_to = 2 -%}
            {%- elsif _h contains 'mirror' or _h contains 'neon' or _h contains 'wall' or _h contains 'sign' -%}
              {%- assign _belongs_to = 3 -%}
            {%- elsif _h contains 'home' or _h contains 'decor' or _h contains 'furniture' or _h contains 'accessor' or _h contains 'table' or _h contains 'vase' -%}
              {%- assign _belongs_to = 4 -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if _belongs_to != _section_idx -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}

            {%- assign _is_all = false -%}
            {%- if _h == 'all' or _h contains 'all-' -%}{%- assign _is_all = true -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- if _priority == 1 and _is_all == false -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- if _priority == 2 and _is_all == true -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}

            {%- if _section_rendered == false -%}
              <div class="casa-submenu__cat-section">{{ _section_label }}</div>
              {%- assign _section_rendered = true -%}
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- assign _child_collection = nil -%}
            {%- if child_link.type == 'collection_link' and child_link.object != blank -%}
              {%- assign _child_collection = child_link.object -%}
            {%- else -%}
              {%- assign _child_collection = collections[_child_url_handle] -%}
            {%- if _child_collection == blank -%}{%- assign _child_collection = collections[child_link.handle] -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- assign _is_featured = false -%}
            {%- assign _bdg = '' -%}
            {%- if _child_collection.metafields.sgl.badge != blank -%}
              {%- assign _bdg = _child_collection.metafields.sgl.badge | downcase -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if _bdg == 'featured' or _bdg == 'best' or _bdg == 'popular' or _bdg == 'hot' -%}
              {%- assign _is_featured = true -%}
            {%- elsif _h == 'best-sellers' or _h == 'bestsellers' -%}
              {%- assign _is_featured = true -%}
            {%- endif -%}

            <a href="{{ child_link.url }}" class="casa-submenu__item casa-submenu__item--cat{% if _is_featured %} casa-submenu__item--featured{% endif %}">
              <span class="casa-submenu__item-name">{{ child_link.title }}</span>
              {%- if _child_collection != blank -%}
                {%- assign _child_count = _child_collection.all_products_count | default: _child_collection.products_count | plus: 0 -%}
                {%- if _child_count > 0 -%}
                  <span class="casa-submenu__item-count">{{ _child_count }} items</span>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endif -%}
              <svg class="casa-submenu__item-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          {%- endfor -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- comment -%} No products and no child links - show empty state {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="casa-submenu__empty">
          <div class="casa-submenu__empty-icon">
            {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'sparkles', size: 24 -%}
          </div>
          <p class="casa-submenu__empty-text">Coming soon!</p>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      Sticky bottom CTA — sits inside the scrolling content area and
      uses `position: sticky` so the bar stays pinned to the bottom
      of the visible viewport. Background is fully solid so list
      items scrolling under the bar are obscured (not bleeding
      through). The sticky element has its own compositing layer so
      iOS Safari can repaint just the scrolling content without
      reflowing the whole panel — the flex-sibling alternative
      caused safe-area-inset-bottom changes during URL-bar
      show/hide to cascade into content layout and visibly flash.
      Default `.btn-primary` (Ink-on-Paper) is correct for the
      Lifestyle Paper surface. Glow / Support panels use Ink, so
      the CSS overrides the visual to white-on-Ink (mirroring
      `.btn-primary-on-dark`).
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      CTA copy — naive "View All {{ link.title }}" reads weird for
      "Shop All" (→ "View All Shop All") and "Best Sellers" (→
      "View All Best Sellers" is OK but stiff). Resolve a clean
      label per top-level link instead.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign _cta_link_title_lc = link.title | downcase | strip -%}
    {%- if _cta_link_title_lc == 'shop all' or _cta_link_title_lc == 'shop' or _cta_link_title_lc == 'all' or _cta_link_title_lc == 'all products' -%}
      {%- assign _cta_label = 'View all products' -%}
    {%- elsif _cta_link_title_lc == 'help' or submenu_variant == 'support' -%}
      {%- assign _cta_label = 'Visit help center' -%}
    {%- elsif _cta_link_title_lc contains 'best seller' -%}
      {%- assign _cta_label = 'Shop best sellers' -%}
    {%- elsif _cta_link_title_lc contains 'new arrival' -%}
      {%- assign _cta_label = 'Shop new arrivals' -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- assign _cta_label = 'Shop ' | append: link.title -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>  <!-- closes .casa-submenu__content -->

  {%- comment -%}
    Bottom CTA — direct flex sibling of .casa-submenu__content (NOT
    inside it, NOT wrapped in a sticky "bar" div). The panel is a
    flex column, so the button naturally sits at the bottom edge of
    the panel surrounded by the panel's own background — no separate
    bar element, no sticky positioning, no own bg behind the button.
    Restoring the pre-2026-05-10 pattern (commit 1367878). The
    sticky-bar wrapper that replaced this caused two regressions:
    a transparent fade strip that let items bleed through, and a
    safe-area-inset-bottom flash on iOS URL-bar show/hide. Plain
    flex sibling avoids both.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <a href="{{ link.url | default: '#' }}" class="casa-submenu__view-all btn btn-primary">
    {{ _cta_label }}
    {%- render 'casa-icon', icon: 'arrow-right', size: 14 -%}
  </a>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     SUBMENU VARIANT COLOR SYSTEM
     Colors inherited from parent .casa-header-section CSS vars
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

  /* ── Glow (default): Purple + Pink ── */
  .casa-submenu-panel--glow {
    --submenu-accent-1: var(--casa-glow-primary, #B0C3FA);
    --submenu-accent-2: var(--casa-glow-secondary, #5E0A02);
    --submenu-accent-1-rgb: var(--casa-glow-primary-rgb, 176, 195, 250);
    --submenu-accent-2-rgb: var(--casa-glow-secondary-rgb, 94, 10, 2);
    --submenu-glow: rgba(var(--casa-glow-primary-rgb, 176, 195, 250), 0.12);
    --submenu-banner-bg: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e, #2d1b4e);
    --submenu-banner-glow-1: rgba(var(--casa-glow-primary-rgb, 176, 195, 250), 0.4);
    --submenu-banner-glow-2: rgba(var(--casa-glow-secondary-rgb, 94, 10, 2), 0.3);
  }

  /* ── Lifestyle: Daylit mood = brand Paper surface ──
     Per brand book "three moods", lifestyle covers Home Decor / Coffee
     Tables / Vases / Furniture — sculptural objects on Paper. The
     drawer surface flips to Paper for these submenus only. Other
     drawers (glow / support) stay Ink. Section header / item / hero
     text colors auto-adapt via the --casa-section-text + override of
     base panel background below. */
  /* Compound selector boosts specificity (2 classes) so this beats
     the base .casa-submenu-panel Ink-frost background that comes
     later in source order. */
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle {
    /* Brand v1 Editorial mood — Paper surface (#FAFAF7), no frost.
       Mirrors the desktop megamenu's Lifestyle treatment so Home
       Decor renders the same on mobile as it does on desktop. */
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--casa-paper) 100%, black 2%) 0%, #FAFAF7 100%);
    color: var(--casa-ink);
    --casa-section-text: var(--casa-ink);
    /* Kill the parent's blur/saturate frost — Paper isn't frosted glass */
    backdrop-filter: none;
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: none;
    /* Cleaner shadow over a light surface */
    box-shadow:
      -4px 0 32px rgba(10, 10, 15, 0.18),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(10, 10, 15, 0.06);

    --submenu-accent-1: var(--casa-lifestyle-primary, #f59e0b);
    --submenu-accent-2: var(--casa-lifestyle-secondary, #d97706);
    --submenu-accent-1-rgb: var(--casa-lifestyle-primary-rgb, 245, 158, 11);
    --submenu-accent-2-rgb: var(--casa-lifestyle-secondary-rgb, 217, 119, 6);
    --submenu-glow: rgba(var(--casa-lifestyle-primary-rgb, 245, 158, 11), 0.1);
    --submenu-banner-bg: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a18, #2d2a1b);
    --submenu-banner-glow-1: rgba(var(--casa-lifestyle-primary-rgb, 245, 158, 11), 0.35);
    --submenu-banner-glow-2: rgba(var(--casa-lifestyle-secondary-rgb, 217, 119, 6), 0.25);
  }

  /* ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
     Lifestyle (Paper) — text-color overrides
     ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
     The default submenu text rules hardcode white-on-Ink colors.
     When the surface flips to Paper for the Lifestyle variant,
     every text element needs to flip to Ink-on-Paper to stay
     legible. Compound selector (.casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-
     panel--lifestyle ...) bumps specificity above the base text
     rules. Stays inside the variant's color tokens (no new colors). */
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu__content,
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu-back,
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu__title,
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu__item,
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu__item-name,
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu__item-price,
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu__cat-headline {
    color: var(--casa-ink);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu__label,
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu__section-title,
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu__cat-section,
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu__item-count,
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu__item-arrow {
    color: rgba(10, 10, 15, 0.55);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu__item-price-old {
    color: rgba(10, 10, 15, 0.4);
  }
  /* Subtle row separators flip to Ink so they actually show on Paper */
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu__item,
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu__header {
    border-color: rgba(10, 10, 15, 0.06);
  }
  /* Back button hover/active background — was white-tint on Ink,
     flip to Ink-tint on Paper */
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu-back:hover,
  .casa-submenu-panel.casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu-back:active {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-tint-rgb), 0.94);
  }

  /* ── Support: Teal + Cyan ── */
  .casa-submenu-panel--support {
    --submenu-accent-1: var(--casa-support-primary, #F2FFA0);
    --submenu-accent-2: var(--casa-support-secondary, #F2FFA0);
    --submenu-accent-1-rgb: var(--casa-support-primary-rgb, 242, 255, 160);
    --submenu-accent-2-rgb: var(--casa-support-secondary-rgb, 8, 145, 178);
    --submenu-glow: rgba(var(--casa-support-primary-rgb, 242, 255, 160), 0.1);
    --submenu-banner-bg: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f1a1a, #1b2d2d);
    --submenu-banner-glow-1: rgba(var(--casa-support-primary-rgb, 242, 255, 160), 0.35);
    --submenu-banner-glow-2: rgba(var(--casa-support-secondary-rgb, 8, 145, 178), 0.25);
  }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     SUBMENU PANEL STYLES
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

  /* ── Submenu Panel ── */
  .casa-submenu-panel {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 340px;
    height: 100%;
    /* Brand v1 frosted Ink — matches the parent .casa-drawer
       (0.72 → 0.78 opacity + 72px blur + saturate 180%). Lighter
       and more frosted than the previous 0.86/0.90 — the page
       underneath shows through enough to feel like real frosted
       glass instead of a semi-solid dark panel. White text still
       clears 4.6:1 (top) → 6.4:1 (bottom) over a white page.
       Lifestyle variant overrides to brand Paper below. */
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-tint-rgb), 0.94);
    box-shadow: 
      -4px 0 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45),
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.08);
    z-index: 100000;
    transform: translateX(-100%);
    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), visibility 0s 0.2s;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
    visibility: hidden;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel.active {
    transform: translateX(0);
    visibility: visible;
    pointer-events: auto;
    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), visibility 0s 0s;
  }
  /* Frost only after the slide settles (.is-settled from casa-navigation.js)
     — a 72px backdrop-filter moving with the slide re-blurs every frame on
     iOS, and every CLOSED panel (one per top-level menu link) used to hold
     a permanent full-height blur layer despite visibility: hidden. */
  .casa-submenu-panel.active.is-settled {
    /* perf-justified: static-only blur while the panel is open; saturate is the brand frosted-Ink identity, matches parent drawer */
    backdrop-filter: blur(72px) saturate(180%);
    /* perf-justified: static-only blur while the panel is open; saturate is the brand frosted-Ink identity, matches parent drawer */
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(72px) saturate(180%);
  }
  /* Slide-in face — same pattern as .casa-drawer__frost-cover: near-solid
     Ink while the panel moves, cross-fades away once .is-settled lands
     the frost. Opacity-only; re-covers the blur-free slide-out on close. */
  .casa-submenu__frost-cover {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -1;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(18, 18, 25, 0.97) 0%, rgba(9, 9, 13, 0.98) 100%);
    opacity: 1;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel.is-settled .casa-submenu__frost-cover {
    opacity: 0;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .casa-submenu__frost-cover { transition: none; }
  }
  /* Variant surfaces: the cover must match the panel it fronts.
     Lifestyle is opaque Paper with no frost at all — no cover needed.
     Glass tints the cover with its own tint token. */
  .casa-submenu-panel--lifestyle .casa-submenu__frost-cover {
    display: none;
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__frost-cover {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-tint-rgb), 0.97);
  }

  /* Ambient glow - uses variant accent color */
  .casa-submenu-panel::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 100px;
    right: 0;
    width: 200px;
    height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse, var(--submenu-glow, rgba(176, 195, 250, 0.12)) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* ── Header ── */
  .casa-submenu__header {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.08);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .casa-submenu-back {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.1);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .casa-submenu-back:active { background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.1); }
  .casa-submenu__title-group { flex: 1; }
  .casa-submenu__label {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.4);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    display: block;
  }
  .casa-submenu__title {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0;
    /* Defensive — every realistic top-level label fits ("Lighting",
       "Home Decor", "Best Sellers", etc.), but if a merchant adds
       a long custom menu item we'd rather ellipsis than wrap. */
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  /* ── Content (scrollable) ── */
  .casa-submenu__content {
    flex: 1;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 16px 0;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* ── Featured Banner ── */
  .casa-submenu__featured-img {
    margin: 0 16px 20px;
    height: 140px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-tint-rgb), 0.94);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  a.casa-submenu__featured-img:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }
  .casa-submenu__featured-img::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 50%, var(--submenu-banner-glow-1, rgba(176, 195, 250, 0.4)), transparent 60%);
  }
  .casa-submenu__featured-img::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 70% 50%, var(--submenu-banner-glow-2, rgba(94, 10, 2, 0.3)), transparent 60%);
  }
  .casa-submenu__featured-photo {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 16px;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .casa-submenu__mirror {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .casa-submenu__featured-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 12px;
    left: 12px;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    border-radius: 20px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    z-index: 2;
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
  }

  /* ── Section Title ── */
  .casa-submenu__section-title {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.3);
    /* Align with the .casa-submenu__list wrapper padding (16px) so
       the eyebrow text starts at the same X as items / section
       headers / headline. */
    padding: 8px 16px;
  }

  /* ── Item List ── 16px wrapper padding sets the baseline left
     edge that items, section headers, and the headline all align to. */
  .casa-submenu__list { padding: 0 16px; }
  .casa-submenu__item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 6px 18px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .casa-submenu__item:active {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.05);
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-img {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.03);
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-photo {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  /* min-width: 0 lets the flex child shrink below its content
     width so the name/price text can truncate instead of forcing
     the row wider than the panel. */
  .casa-submenu__item-content { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .casa-submenu__item-name {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
    /* Hard rule: NEVER wraps to a second line. Ellipsis on long
       product names ("Parisian Bubble Girls - Colored Glass" etc.). */
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }
  /* flex-wrap lets the whole was-price drop to a 2nd line as one unit at the
     narrowest widths — the price spans are nowrap so a price NEVER splits its
     number from its currency code (the "8.841.000 / VND" fragmenting seen in
     VND). Worst case is a clean two-line stack, never a broken 2×2 grid. */
  .casa-submenu__item-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 2px 8px; }
  .casa-submenu__item-price {
    font-size: var(--casa-submenu-price-size, 13px);
    font-weight: var(--casa-submenu-price-weight, 600);
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-price-old {
    font-size: var(--casa-submenu-compare-price-size, 11px);
    color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.4);
    text-decoration: line-through;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-badge {
    font-size: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 3px 6px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--card-badge-text, #ffffff);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  /* Tag-fallback badges (used when product has no custom.badges metafield) */
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--bestseller { background: var(--card-badge-bestseller-bg, var(--submenu-accent-1, #B0C3FA)); }
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--new { background: var(--card-badge-new-bg, var(--casa-green, #22c55e)); }
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--sale { background: var(--card-badge-urgency-bg, var(--casa-red, #ef4444)); }
  /* Metafield badges — same handle-suffix scheme as casa-product-card so colors match across the site */
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #B0C3FA, #6366f1);
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-1-bestseller,
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-bestseller {
    background: var(--card-badge-bestseller-bg, linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #ef4444));
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-new-arrival,
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-new {
    background: var(--card-badge-new-bg, var(--grad-primary, linear-gradient(135deg, #B0C3FA, #5E0A02)));
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-use-code-new20 {
    background: var(--card-badge-new-bg, linear-gradient(135deg, #F2FFA0, #B0C3FA));
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-gift-favorite {
    background: var(--card-badge-gift-favorite-bg, linear-gradient(135deg, #5E0A02, #5E0A02));
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-editor-s-pick {
    background: var(--card-badge-editors-pick-bg, linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a, #334155));
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-limited-edition,
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-limited {
    background: var(--card-badge-limited-bg, linear-gradient(135deg, #f59e0b, #d97706));
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-trending,
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-hot {
    background: var(--card-badge-trending-bg, linear-gradient(135deg, #ef4444, #f97316));
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-eco-friendly,
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-eco {
    background: var(--card-badge-eco-bg, linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669));
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-exclusive {
    background: var(--card-badge-exclusive-bg, linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a, #334155));
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-handmade,
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-artisan {
    background: var(--card-badge-handmade-bg, linear-gradient(135deg, #B0C3FA, #B0C3FA));
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-free-shipping {
    background: var(--card-badge-free-shipping-bg, linear-gradient(135deg, #F2FFA0, #F2FFA0));
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-best-value,
  .casa-submenu__item-badge--meta-value {
    background: var(--card-badge-best-value-bg, linear-gradient(135deg, #22c55e, #16a34a));
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-arrow {
    color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.3);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* ── Child Link Items ── */
  .casa-submenu__item-icon {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(var(--submenu-accent-1-rgb, 176, 195, 250), 0.15), rgba(var(--submenu-accent-2-rgb, 94, 10, 2), 0.1));
    border: 1px solid rgba(var(--submenu-accent-1-rgb, 176, 195, 250), 0.2);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--submenu-accent-1, #B0C3FA);
  }
  .casa-submenu__item-count {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.4);
    display: block;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     Option C — text-led, sectioned (category list only).
     Scoped under .casa-submenu__item--cat so it doesn't affect
     the product card layout that shares the same base class.
     Reference: mockups/megamenu-options.html.
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  .casa-submenu__item--cat {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    /* Flush-left items so the name aligns with eyebrow / headline /
       section header at the .casa-submenu__list wrapper's 16px edge.
       Right padding keeps chevron breathing room from the row's
       right edge. */
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 12px 12px 12px 0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .casa-submenu__item--cat:hover,
  .casa-submenu__item--cat:active {
    background: rgba(94, 10, 2, 0.04);
  }
  .casa-submenu__item--cat.casa-submenu__item--featured::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 4px;
    top: 12px;
    bottom: 12px;
    width: 2px;
    border-radius: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--submenu-accent-1, #B0C3FA), var(--submenu-accent-2, #5E0A02));
  }
  .casa-submenu__item--cat .casa-submenu__item-name {
    font-family: var(--font-body--family);
    /* Mobile drawer is 380px wide — even with name + count + chevron
       all on one line, 15px Inter 600 fits "Perfect For Gifting" plus
       "108 ITEMS" plus 12px chevron comfortably. Hard rule: NEVER
       wraps to a 2nd line. Ellipsis if a merchant-added category
       title overruns the available row width. */
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #5E0A02;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }
  .casa-submenu__item--cat .casa-submenu__item-count {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.10em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(94, 10, 2, 0.55);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .casa-submenu__item--cat .casa-submenu__item-arrow {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    color: rgba(94, 10, 2, 0.45);
    transition: transform 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .casa-submenu__item--cat:hover .casa-submenu__item-arrow,
  .casa-submenu__item--cat:active .casa-submenu__item-arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
    color: rgba(94, 10, 2, 0.85);
  }
  /* Support-variant lead icon. Quiet white at 60% opacity by default,
     warms to brand purple on hover/focus. Fixed 18×18 box so every row
     aligns regardless of icon shape. */
  .casa-submenu__item--cat .casa-submenu__item-leadicon {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: rgba(94, 10, 2, 0.6);
    transition: color 0.18s ease;
  }
  .casa-submenu__item--cat .casa-submenu__item-leadicon svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
  .casa-submenu__item--cat:hover .casa-submenu__item-leadicon,
  .casa-submenu__item--cat:active .casa-submenu__item-leadicon,
  .casa-submenu__item--cat:focus-visible .casa-submenu__item-leadicon {
    color: var(--submenu-accent-1, #B0C3FA);
  }

  /* Section header — JetBrains Mono UPPERCASE "spec register",
     mirrors casa-mega-menu.liquid. Mobile drawer is wider than the
     desktop column so we can scale the type up to 12px (vs 11px on
     desktop) and increase the divider line slightly for breathing
     room. */
  .casa-submenu__cat-section {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    /* Theme-aware: Casa Paper #FAFAF7 on Ink drawers (default), Casa
       Ink #0A0A0F on Paper drawers (Lifestyle / Home Decor). The
       --casa-section-text variable switches per variant so the section
       header always has reliable contrast. */
    color: var(--casa-section-text, var(--casa-glass-text));
    text-shadow: 0 1px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
    /* Flush-left to align with eyebrow / headline / items. */
    padding: 20px 0 10px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.1);
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .casa-submenu__cat-section:first-child {
    border-top: none;
    margin-top: 0;
    padding-top: 6px;
  }
  /* Hairline accent under the subcategory eyebrow ("SHOP" / "LAMPS"
     / "WALLS & SURFACES" / etc.) — quiet section mark between the
     label and the items grouped under it. Mirrors the desktop
     .casa-mega-cat-section::after rule so navigation feels
     consistent across mobile drawer and desktop dropdown.
     currentColor inherits the parent's section-text color so it
     adapts to Paper-mode (Ink) and Ink-mode (dim white). */
  .casa-submenu__cat-section::after {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    background: currentColor;
    opacity: 0.5;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     Option G — brand-voice headline + featured hero card.
     Mirrors casa-mega-menu.liquid; mobile drawer is the wider
     surface (380px vs 280px desktop column) so we can scale the
     headline up. Reference: mockups/megamenu-wow-options.html.
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  .casa-submenu__cat-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-body--family);
    font-size: clamp(20px, 5.6vw, 24px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: #5E0A02;
    /* 16px horizontal gutter so headline aligns with the section
       title + items list below. (Used to inherit this from
       .casa-submenu__list when the headline lived inside it; now
       that it's lifted to the top of the panel we apply the gutter
       directly.) */
    margin: 8px 0 16px 0;
    padding: 0 16px;
  }
  .casa-submenu__cat-headline em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 800;
    background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--submenu-accent-1, #B0C3FA), var(--submenu-accent-2, #5E0A02), #F2FFA0);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     SUPPORT FEATURED CARD
     Mirrors the desktop megamenu's Contact Us card. Lives at the
     top of the Help / Support panel under the brand-voice headline
     and above the topics list. Compact, scannable, and tappable —
     email / phone / chat each open the native handler.
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  .casa-submenu__support-card {
    margin: 0 16px 16px 16px;
    padding: 16px;
    background: 
      radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, rgba(242, 255, 160, 0.18) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 0% 100%, rgba(176, 195, 250, 0.16) 0%, transparent 55%),
      rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.08);
    border-radius: 16px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  /* Subtle 2px top edge in the support accent gradient — same
     accent as the desktop megamenu so the moment reads consistent
     across breakpoints. */
  .casa-submenu__support-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--casa-support-primary, #F2FFA0), var(--casa-glow-primary, #B0C3FA), var(--casa-glow-secondary, #5E0A02));
  }
  .casa-submenu__support-label {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.75);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .casa-submenu__support-label svg {
    color: var(--casa-support-primary, #F2FFA0);
  }
  .casa-submenu__support-title {
    font-family: var(--font-body--family);
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
    margin: 0 0 6px 0;
  }
  .casa-submenu__support-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-body--family);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.7);
    margin: 0 0 14px 0;
  }
  .casa-submenu__support-methods {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .casa-submenu__support-method {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 10px;
    margin: 0 -10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
    font-family: var(--font-body--family);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: background 0.18s ease;
    min-height: 44px;
  }
  .casa-submenu__support-method:hover,
  .casa-submenu__support-method:active,
  .casa-submenu__support-method:focus-visible {
    background: rgba(94, 10, 2, 0.06);
  }
  .casa-submenu__support-method:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--casa-support-primary, #F2FFA0);
    outline-offset: -2px;
  }
  .casa-submenu__support-method-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(242, 255, 160, 0.12);
    color: var(--casa-support-primary, #F2FFA0);
  }
  .casa-submenu__support-method-text {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }
  .casa-submenu__support-method-arrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.4);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: transform 0.18s ease, color 0.18s ease;
  }
  .casa-submenu__support-method:hover .casa-submenu__support-method-arrow {
    color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.85);
    transform: translateX(2px);
  }
  /* In-card CTA button — uses .btn .btn-primary, but on Ink frost
     so flip to white-on-Ink visual same as the sticky CTA. */
  .casa-submenu__support-btn {
    width: 100%;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--casa-paper);
    color: var(--casa-ink);
    border: 1px solid rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.18);
  }
  .casa-submenu__support-btn:hover,
  .casa-submenu__support-btn:active {
    background: #F1F1F1;
    color: var(--casa-ink);
  }

  .casa-submenu__cat-hero {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    /* 16px horizontal margin so the hero card aligns with the
       headline + section title + items list. Margin (not padding)
       because the hero's <img> is position: absolute and would
       bleed past padding to the edge of the link. */
    margin: 0 16px 12px 16px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    /* 3:2 instead of 16:9 — most Casa collection covers are 1:1
       square photos (the Shopify default), so the previous 16:9
       crop clipped ~28% off top + bottom equally and shoved the
       subject toward the edges of the visible card. 3:2 trims
       only ~13% off each side, so subjects composed in the
       upper-middle of the source image (typical product
       photography) now sit visually centered in the hero card.
       Merchants can still fine-tune any specific collection via
       the casa.focal_x / casa.focal_y metafields. */
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2a1850 0%, #6b2890 35%, #B0C3FA 70%, #5E0A02 100%);
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #fff;
    isolation: isolate;
  }
  .casa-submenu__cat-hero-img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.4s ease;
  }
  .casa-submenu__cat-hero:active .casa-submenu__cat-hero-img {
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }
  .casa-submenu__cat-hero:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--submenu-accent-2, #5E0A02);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .casa-submenu__cat-hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    /* Bottom-up dark gradient only — strong enough to ensure tag and
       collection name are legible on any source image. */
    background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.82) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.45) 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0.12) 75%, transparent 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .casa-submenu__cat-hero-content {
    position: absolute;
    left: 14px;
    right: 14px;
    bottom: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .casa-submenu__cat-hero-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .casa-submenu__cat-hero-tag {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
    text-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  }
  .casa-submenu__cat-hero-name {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: #fff;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .casa-submenu__cat-hero-arrow {
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    /* Dark backdrop + 1px border so the circle stays visible on any
       collection image. */
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: background 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
  }
  .casa-submenu__cat-hero-arrow svg {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
  }
  .casa-submenu__cat-hero:active .casa-submenu__cat-hero-arrow {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    transform: translateX(2px);
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .casa-submenu__cat-hero-img,
    .casa-submenu__cat-hero-arrow {
      transition: none;
    }
    .casa-submenu__cat-hero:active .casa-submenu__cat-hero-img {
      transform: none;
    }
  }

  /* ── Empty State ── */
  .casa-submenu__empty {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .casa-submenu__empty-icon {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(var(--submenu-accent-1-rgb, 176, 195, 250), 0.15), rgba(var(--submenu-accent-2-rgb, 94, 10, 2), 0.1));
    border: 1px solid rgba(var(--submenu-accent-1-rgb, 176, 195, 250), 0.2);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--submenu-accent-1, #B0C3FA);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .casa-submenu__empty-text {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.5);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     Bottom CTA — brand v1 aligned.
     The button is a direct flex sibling of .casa-submenu__content,
     so flex layout naturally pins it to the bottom edge of the
     panel. There is no wrapper "bar" element and no own bg behind
     the button — the panel's own surface fills the space around
     the button on all four sides, so the button reads as "the
     button sitting on the panel" rather than "a button on top of
     a separate bar". `.btn .btn-primary` supplies the pill styling.
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  .casa-submenu__view-all {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin: 12px 16px 16px;
    /* `.btn` is `display: inline-flex` by default. Switching to
       `display: flex` makes it a block-level flex item so it stretches
       to fill the panel's width minus the side margins above. */
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .casa-submenu__view-all svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* Glow / Support are Ink-surface drawers — use the on-dark CTA
     treatment. Lifestyle stays on default .btn-primary which is
     the Ink-on-Paper treatment. */
  .casa-submenu-panel--glow .casa-submenu__view-all,
  .casa-submenu-panel--support .casa-submenu__view-all {
    /* Apply on-dark visual without renaming the class. Mirrors what
       the .btn-primary-on-dark class would supply. */
    background: var(--casa-paper);
    color: var(--casa-ink);
    border: 1px solid rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.18);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glow .casa-submenu__view-all:hover,
  .casa-submenu-panel--support .casa-submenu__view-all:hover {
    background: #F1F1F1;
  }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     RESPONSIVE: VERY SMALL MOBILE (375px and below)
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  @media (max-width: 375px) {
    .casa-submenu__header {
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__back {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__title {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__close {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__categories {
      padding: 12px;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__cat-item {
      padding: 10px 12px;
      gap: 10px;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__cat-icon {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__cat-name {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__cat-count {
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__products-title {
      padding: 10px 16px;
      font-size: 9px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__products-grid {
      padding: 12px;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__product-card {
      padding: 10px;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__product-img {
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__product-name {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__product-price {
      font-size: 12px;
    }
  }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     RESPONSIVE: EXTRA SMALL MOBILE (320px and below)
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
  @media (max-width: 320px) {
    .casa-submenu__header {
      padding: 12px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__back,
    .casa-submenu__close {
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__title {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__categories {
      padding: 10px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__cat-item {
      padding: 8px 10px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__cat-icon {
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__cat-name {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__products-grid {
      padding: 10px;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__product-card {
      padding: 8px;
    }

    .casa-submenu__product-name {
      font-size: 11px;
    }
  }

  /* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     GLASSMORPHIC SUBMENU PANEL
     Inherits --casa-glass-* variables from :root
     Overrides every white-based color in the base panel.
     ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

  /* ── Panel background & base color ──
     backdrop-filter is moved to the .active scope below. The panel uses
     visibility: hidden when closed, but visibility doesn't free the GPU
     compositing layer for an active backdrop-filter — the blur keeps
     getting recomputed every scroll tick, contributing to nav flicker.
     Apply the blur only while the panel is actually shown. */
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-tint-rgb), var(--casa-glass-opacity));
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass.active.is-settled {
    /* perf-justified: static-only blur (is-settled lands after the slide); saturate is the glass-variant identity */
    backdrop-filter: blur(var(--casa-glass-blur)) saturate(180%);
    /* perf-justified: static-only blur (is-settled lands after the slide); saturate is the glass-variant identity */
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(var(--casa-glass-blur)) saturate(180%);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass::before,
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass::after { display: none; }

  /* ── Header ── */
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__header {
    border-bottom-color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-border-rgb), 0.25);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu-back {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-icon-bg-rgb), 0.35);
    border-color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-border-rgb), 0.3);
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu-back:active {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-icon-bg-rgb), 0.55);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__title {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__label {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text-muted);
  }

  /* ── Section title ("POPULAR IN LIGHTING") ── */
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__section-title {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text-muted);
  }

  /* ── Item rows (product items & child links) ── */
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__item {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__item:active {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-icon-bg-rgb), 0.3);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__item-img {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-card-bg-rgb), 0.5);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__item-name {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__item-price {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__item-price-old {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text-muted);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__item-count {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text-muted);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__item-arrow {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text-muted);
  }

  /* ── Child link icon circles ── */
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__item-icon {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-icon-bg-rgb), 0.4);
    border-color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-border-rgb), 0.3);
    color: var(--casa-glass-icon-active);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__item:active .casa-submenu__item-icon {
    background: var(--casa-glass-icon-active);
    color: var(--casa-glass-card-bg);
  }

  /* ── Featured banner ── */
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__featured-img {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-card-bg-rgb), 0.3);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__featured-img::before,
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__featured-img::after {
    display: none;
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__featured-badge {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.6);
    color: var(--casa-glass-card-bg);
  }

  /* ── Product cards (if present) ── */
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__product-card {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-card-bg-rgb), 0.4);
    border-color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-border-rgb), 0.25);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__product-name {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__product-price {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text-muted);
  }

  /* ── Empty state ── */
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__empty-icon {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-icon-bg-rgb), 0.4);
    border-color: rgba(var(--casa-glass-border-rgb), 0.3);
    color: var(--casa-glass-icon-active);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__empty-text {
    color: var(--casa-glass-text-muted);
  }

  /* ── View All CTA ── */
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__view-all {
    background: var(--casa-glass-btn-bg, var(--casa-glass-icon-active));
    color: var(--casa-glass-btn-text, var(--casa-glass-card-bg));
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(var(--casa-glass-text-rgb), 0.15);
  }
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__view-all:active {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  /* ── Scrollbar ── */
  .casa-submenu-panel--glass .casa-submenu__content::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background: rgba(var(--casa-glass-border-rgb), 0.3);
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
